  "summary": "Apache Tomcat - Possible TLS 1.3 connection failures",
  "details": "Incomplete cleanup vulnerability in Apache Tomcat could cause TLS 1.3 connections to fail intermittently.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.0-M21 through 11.0.26, from 10.1.25 through 10.1.60, from 9.0.90 through 9.0.122.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.27, 10.1.61 or 9.0.123, which fix the issue.",
  "severity": [
    {
      "type": "CVSS_V3",
      "score": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L"
    }
